<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.259 pts off FTSE, Sept 16.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.259 pts off FTSE, Sept 16.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 index stocks will go ex-dividend on September 16 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 1.259 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>    * Cadbury Schweppe	    5.20  6.500  0.377</p>
<p>    * Schroders			6.00  7.500  0.023</p>
<p>    * Zeneca Group		  12.50 15.625  0.859</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
